WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.473
When markets move, perspective matters. Buffer helps you understand the price effect

00:00:05.473 --> 00:00:09.742
on your perpetual positions, one clear scenario at a time.

00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:15.837
Start with a sample. Choose a shared price move. See a transparent

00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:21.033
estimate for supported perpetual positions, with no wallet signature or trade required.

00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:26.561
A SOL long and a Bitcoin short react differently. Buffer shows each

00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:31.189
contribution and the combined result, so a single number has a clear

00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:31.575
explanation.

00:00:32.475 --> 00:00:38.353
Unsupported contracts and other account exposure stay visible. This is a focused

00:00:38.353 --> 00:00:43.742
price model, with clear boundaries around funding, fees, collateral, and liquidation.

00:00:44.642 --> 00:00:49.296
Read the method. Inspect the assumptions. Export the inputs and results. Buffer

00:00:49.296 --> 00:00:53.950
turns a market what if into something you can understand and verify.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:59.110
Built for a calmer view of your positions. Open the demo and

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:01.950
try a sample. Buffer. A little more perspective.
